title: "God Bless The United States Of Aliens: An All-Seeing Eyewitness Report"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Web-based, AI-voiced sound performance of a short story by Chris-Armel
  Iradukunda (daqhris), co-directed with Claude Opus 4.7 (AI model, Anthropic)
  and voiced with Kokoro-82M. Shown as a guest work in Domus Diasporica, the
  Pavilion of Bosnia and Herzegovina at the 61st International Art Exhibition,
  La Biennale di Venezia, 9 May to 22 November 2026.
